00:06:39.966 --> 00:06:42.068
ALTERNATIVE HAS THE POWER TO

00:06:42.135 --> 00:06:42.635
INVESTIGATE UNFAIR PRACTICE

00:06:42.702 --> 00:06:44.971
CHARGES, DETERMINE WHETHER THOSE

00:06:45.037 --> 00:06:46.038
CHARGES ARE JUSTIFIED, AND, IF

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:47.707
