00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:54.680
AN UNFAIR LEVERAGE THAT IS NOT

00:06:54.747 --> 00:06:55.815
PRESENT IN OTHER PARTS OF THE

00:06:55.882 --> 00:06:58.151
