00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:06.125
NOT AFFORDED THE SAME EXTENT OF

00:07:06.192 --> 00:07:07.126
PROTECTIONS THAT OTHER PUBLIC

00:07:07.193 --> 00:07:09.462
EMPLOYEE UNIONS OBTAIN FROM PERB

00:07:09.529 --> 00:07:12.498
