00:07:12.565 --> 00:07:13.533
LEGISLATURE ENACTED PROTECTIONS

00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:15.868
TO PROHIBIT UNION BUSTING WITHIN

00:07:15.935 --> 00:07:18.337
THE JURISDICTION OF PERB THAT

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:19.472
YEAR, SB 857 PROHIBITED PERB

00:07:19.539 --> 00:07:21.440
FROM AWARDING STRIKE PREPARATION

00:07:21.507 --> 00:07:23.943
EXPENSES AS DAMAGES FROM AN

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:25.011
