00:07:27.213 --> 00:07:28.815
RELATIONS ENTITIES IN THE CITY

00:07:28.881 --> 00:07:29.916
AND COUNTY OF LOS ANGELES WERE

00:07:29.982 --> 00:07:30.883
EXPRESSLY IDENTIFIED IN THE LAW,

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.985
WHICH MEANS THESE PROTECTIONS

00:07:33.052 --> 00:07:34.587
WERE NOT EXPRESSLY IDENTIFIED IN

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:36.689
THE LAW, WHICH MEANS THAT THESE

00:07:36.756 --> 00:07:38.224
PROTECTIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO

00:07:38.291 --> 00:07:39.225
UNIONS UNDER THEIR JURISDICTION.

00:07:39.292 --> 00:07:41.327
MANY OF THE ACTIVITIES WORKERS

00:07:41.394 --> 00:07:42.361
ROUTINELY ENGAGE IN DURING A

00:07:42.428 --> 00:07:44.263
CONTRACT CAMPAIGN, SUCH AS

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.231
MEMBERSHIP RALLIES, WEARING

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:47.333
UNION BUTTONS, OR PARTICIPATING

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.434
