00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:50.069
COULD BE USED TO JUSTIFY THESE

00:07:50.136 --> 00:07:51.838
DAMAGES. HOWEVER, I THINK WE CAN

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.739
ALL AGREE THE RIGHT TO

00:07:53.806 --> 00:07:55.174
COLLECTIVELY BARGAIN IS NOT

00:07:55.241 --> 00:07:56.175
MEANINGFUL IF WORKERS CANNOT

00:07:56.242 --> 00:07:58.244
ENGAGE IN CONCERTED ACTIVITIES.

00:07:58.311 --> 00:07:59.278
THIS BILL NOT ONLY IS ABOUT

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:01.781
ALIGNING LABOR PRACTICES ACROSS

00:08:01.848 --> 00:08:04.650
THE STATE, IT'S ABOUT A FAIRNESS

00:08:04.717 --> 00:08:05.785
FOR ALL PUBLIC SECTOR EMPLOYEES

00:08:05.852 --> 00:08:07.920
IN CALIFORNIA. SO AB 2889

00:08:07.987 --> 00:08:10.656
PROVIDES PERB WITH EXCLUSIVE

00:08:10.723 --> 00:08:11.190
