00:08:11.257 --> 00:08:13.893
REQUESTS FOR INJUNCTIVE RELIEF

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.127
BY BOTH THE CITY AND COUNTY OF

00:08:15.194 --> 00:08:17.463
LOS ANGELES. JUST AS IT ALREADY

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.433
HAS FOR OTHER PUBLIC AGENCIES.

00:08:20.499 --> 00:08:21.500
IT ALSO CLARIFIES THAT LOCAL

00:08:21.567 --> 00:08:23.669
EMPLOYEE RELATIONS ENTITIES IN

00:08:23.736 --> 00:08:24.804
THE CITY AND COUNTY OF LOS

00:08:24.871 --> 00:08:25.905
ANGELES DO NOT HAVE THE

00:08:25.972 --> 00:08:26.973
AUTHORITY TO AWARD DAMAGES

00:08:27.039 --> 00:08:29.342
RESULTING FROM A STRIKE BECAUSE,

00:08:29.408 --> 00:08:30.409
OF COURSE, THIS HAS BEEN

00:08:30.476 --> 00:08:31.410
TRANSFERRED TO PERB. THIS

00:08:31.477 --> 00:08:32.712
ENSURES THAT LOCAL PUBLIC SECTOR

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:34.480
UNIONS AND THE CITY AND COUNTY

00:08:34.547 --> 00:08:35.781
OF LOS ANGELES HAVE THE SAME THE

00:08:35.848 --> 00:08:38.017
VERY SAME PROTECTION FROM UNION

00:08:38.084 --> 00:08:39.085
BUSTING TACTICS THAT ALL OTHER

00:08:39.151 --> 00:08:41.254
UNIONS UNDER PERB JURISDICTION

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:44.257
HAVE ENJOYED FOR OVER A DECADE.

00:08:44.323 --> 00:08:45.424
THIS BILL HAS NO REGISTERED

